          "overview": "Sue's will reading leaves everybody in shock. While Sam and Charlie are furious, Percy is utterly lost. She, Delilah, and Chantal admit some hard truths to both each other and themselves, and Percy wonders whatever happened to the girl she once was... the girl who wrote scary stories, swam across the lake, and wasn't afraid to go after what-and who-she wanted.",
